{"id": "xinjing_xuanzang", "type": "Text", "title": "般若波罗蜜多心经", "title_zh": "般若波罗蜜多心经", "translator": "玄奘", "category": "般若部类", "volume": "", "juan_count": 1, "actual_char_count": 337, "canon_ref": "T.251", "taisho": "T0251", "vehicle": "大乘", "mode": "显教", "translation_place": "翠微寺", "time_from": 648, "belongs_to_school": ["般若", "中观宗", "三论宗"], "parallel_translations": [], "kepan": {"序分": [], "正宗分": ["c000"], "流通分": []}, "chapters": [{"id": "c000", "chapter_no": 1, "chapter_title": "正文", "section_type": "章节", "part_of_kepan": "正宗分", "paragraphs": ["p00000", "p00001", "p00002", "p00003"], "gathas": [], "mantras": [], "figures": ["p103", "p203"], "doctrines": ["c002", "c005", "c008", "c011"], "char_count": 331}], "paragraphs": [{"id": "p00000", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 1, "text_preview": "观自在菩萨，行深般若波罗蜜多时，照见五蕴皆空，度一切苦厄。", "char_count": 29, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": ["p103"], "doctrines": ["c011"]}, {"id": "p00001", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 2, "text_preview": "舍利子，色不异空，空不异色；色即是空，空即是色。受、想、行、识，亦复如是。", "char_count": 37, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": ["p203"], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00002", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 3, "text_preview": "舍利子，是诸法空相，不生不灭，不垢不净，不增不减。是故空中无色，无受、想、行、识；无眼、耳、鼻、舌、身、意；无色、声、香、味、触、法；无眼界，乃至无意识界；无无", "char_count": 162, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": ["p203"], "doctrines": ["c005", "c008"]}, {"id": "p00003", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 4, "text_preview": "三世诸佛，依般若波罗蜜多故，得阿耨多罗三藐三菩提。故知般若波罗蜜多，是大神咒，是大明咒，是无上咒，是无等等咒，能除一切苦，真实不虚。故说般若波罗蜜多咒，即说咒曰", "char_count": 103, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": ["c002"]}], "gathas": [], "mantras": [], "figure_mentions": [{"figure_id": "p103", "name": "观世音菩萨", "chapters": ["c000"], "mention_count": 1}, {"figure_id": "p203", "name": "舍利弗", "chapters": ["c000"], "mention_count": 1}], "doctrine_mentions": [{"concept_id": "c011", "name": "五蕴", "chapters": ["c000"], "mention_count": 1}, {"concept_id": "c005", "name": "空性", "chapters": ["c000"], "mention_count": 1}, {"concept_id": "c008", "name": "涅槃", "chapters": ["c000"], "mention_count": 1}, {"concept_id": "c002", "name": "真如", "chapters": ["c000"], "mention_count": 1}], "translator_note": "", "transmission_events": ["event:translation:玄奘"]}